# Tests that fail on Percona Server 9.7.2 for reasons outside VillageSQL.
#
# thread_pool: Percona PS-11352 (5448fde376c) makes the upstream (Oracle)
# thread_pool plugin refuse to initialize, in favor of Percona's built-in
# thread pool (--thread-handling=pool-of-threads).  The suite was left as is,
# so its tests run against a plugin that never starts.  Remove these entries
# if Percona revives the plugin.
#
# main.user_host_name expects the percona.telemetry user, which exists only in
# builds with WITH_PERCONA_TELEMETRY=ON.
main.user_host_name : BUG#0 VillageSQL - needs a build with WITH_PERCONA_TELEMETRY=ON
thread_pool.telemetry_traces_server : BUG#0 VillageSQL - PS-11352 disabled the upstream thread_pool plugin
